            "block_label": "table",
            "block_content": "<table><tr><td>.003&quot;</td><td>.003&quot;</td><td>.004&quot;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">(Bar test 3&quot; from end of jaw.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">Bar diameter same as hole)</td></tr></table>",
